author=E3N
summary=Configurable HyperOS Millet/Greeze no-restrict guard
description=Keeps user-selected apps in MILLET_NO_RESTRICT_APP while preserving unrelated entries. Includes Xiaomi GMS limiter handling, FCM reconnect recovery, and stale-lock self-healing.
